# Mutation plan for the session write family (api4/user.go:2602-2825).
#
#   scripts/mutate-batch.sh scripts/mutations/session-writes.plan
#
# The decisions these cover, in the order CLAUDE.md ranks them: which permission gates each
# route, the *order* of the four checks in `revokeSession` and of the four validations in
# `handleDeviceProps`, which column the device predicate compares, which of five error ids each
# refusal carries, and the three constants a reader drops — `ExpiredNotify = false`, the
# `Max-Age` zero case, and the existing-column fallback that stops a one-sided device update
# from wiping the other id.
#
# The two controls are last. If either comes back CAUGHT the batch is void.
